body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 20px;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f8f8f8;
        }

        .table-container {
            width: 100%;
            overflow-x: auto; /* Enables horizontal scrolling on small screens */
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .intensity-bar {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #f3e5ab, #8b4513);
            width: 100%;
            height: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .intensity-indicator {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            height: 100%;
            width: 5%;
            background-color: black;
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: left 0.3s;
            left: 86%; /* Adjusted for 1-13 scale (Intensity ~12) */
        }

        .intensity-scale {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            body {
                margin: 10px;
            }

            .table-container {
                padding: 10px;
            }

            table {
                font-size: 14px;
            }

            th, td {
                padding: 10px;
            }

            .intensity-bar {
                height: 15px;
            }

            .intensity-scale {
                font-size: 10px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            table {
                font-size: 12px;
            }

            th, td {
                padding: 8px;
            }

            .intensity-bar {
                height: 12px;
            }

            .intensity-scale {
                font-size: 9px;
            }
        }





 Product 
 Barrel Roll | C3 | Coffee Bag 


 Roast Profile 
 Medium Roast 


 Tasting Notes 
 Cedar, Dark Grapes, Rich Honey &amp; Warming Spice 


 Intensity 





 Soft   Balanced   Strong 

 Intensity Level:(3/5) 



 Terroir &amp; Process 

 Process : Wooden Cask Aged Arabica Coffee 
 Varietal -  S795 &amp; Sarchimor 
 Elevation - 1000 - 1200 m.a.s.l 



 Origin 
 Bababudan Giri, Ka, India 


